{"id":"b7dd94f2e654aefb","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-strongly-inaccessible.md","title":"Strongly Inaccessible","display":"df-strongly-inaccessible — Strongly Inaccessible","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-strongly-inaccessible","aliases":["58-df-strongly-inaccessible"],"display":"df-strongly-inaccessible — Strongly Inaccessible","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-strongly-inaccessible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-strongly-inaccessible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-inaccessible — Strongly Inaccessible"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\)</span>（强极限基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（此处定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}inaccessible} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa&gt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}inaccessible} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa&gt;\\omega\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>强不可达基数就是不可数、正则、强极限基数。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 强不可达，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V_\\kappa,\\in)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\((V_\\kappa,\\in)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>forcing 是否保持不可达性取决于它是否保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的正则性与强极限性，不能仅凭一个笼统 closure 或 chain-condition 标签判断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e81c8573f40b6c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"",